B.adq=new A.bA("what-is-perimenopause",B.k0,"What is perimenopause?",B.b8C,B.bfa,B.bp2,null,B.aC2,B.bC)
B.bdj=s(["Is there a test for menopause?","Do I need a blood test to know if I am in menopause?","What are the signs of menopause?"],t.s)
B.b1T=s(["signs","test","fsh","diagnosed","started"],t.s)
B.bbH=s(["For most women over 45, menopause is recognised from your periods and symptoms rather than a test: it has happened once you have gone 12 months without a period.","Hormone blood tests (like FSH) go up and down a lot during perimenopause, so a single result often can't say where you are. Doctors mostly use them for younger women or when the picture is unclear.","Common early signs are changes in your cycle, hot flashes or night sweats, trouble sleeping, mood changes and vaginal dryness."],t.s)
B.bcm=s([B.WR,B.X_,B.rb],t.P)
B.adi=new A.bA("am-i-in-menopause",B.k0,"How do I know if I am in menopause?",B.bdj,B.b1T,B.bbH,"If your periods stop or symptoms start before 45, or you are not sure what is going on, it is worth a visit.",B.bcm,B.bC)
B.bdk=s(["My periods are irregular","Why are my periods heavier?","Skipped period perimenopause"],t.s)
B.b4g=s(["period","periods","irregular","heavy","cycle","spotting"],t.s)
B.b8T=s(["Yes, changing periods are usually the first sign of perimenopause. They can come closer together or further apart, be lighter or heavier, and you may skip some.","Keeping a simple note of dates and flow (the Journal works for this) makes it easier to describe to your doctor."],t.s)
